00:51:29.430 --> 00:51:31.920
Bandai Namco, how are
they using Cloud Spanner?

00:51:31.920 --> 00:51:33.710
And the session that
I just mentioned,

00:51:33.710 --> 00:51:35.460
"See What's New with
